{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Curated query expansion. Each group lists words a developer uses interchangeably when describing a problem. A prompt word adds the other words of its group at reduced weight (retrieval.SYNONYM_WEIGHT), only if the library contains them, and synonyms never count toward the coordination guard (MIN_MATCHED). Groups are single words after normalization (X.js -> xjs, n+1 -> nplusone). Keep groups general engineering vocabulary: a group added to fix one benchmark case is overfitting.",
